s-dftd3
------------------------------------------
Library first implementation of the D3 dispersion correction

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgfortran5-14.4.0-1
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  libmctc-lib-devel-0.7.0-1bl1
  libmctc-lib0-0.7.0-1bl1
  libs-dftd3-devel-1.7.0-1bl1
  libs-dftd3_1-1.7.0-1bl1
  libtoml-f0-0.5.2-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-fortran-14.4.0-1
  libmctc-lib-devel-0.7.0-1bl1
  libmstore-devel-0.4.0-1bl1
  libtoml-f-devel-0.5.2-1bl1
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/dftd3/simple-dftd3

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/dftd3/simple-dftd3/archive/refs/tags/v1.7.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack s-dftd3-1.7.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./s-dftd3-1.7.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/s-dftd3-1.7.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/s-dftd3-1.7.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libs-dftd3_1-1.7.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libs-dftd3-devel-1.7.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

